// REJECTS: Unexpected token 'SchemaMappers'. Valid alternatives: [')']
//
// A RelationalMapper element's three sections are ordered:
//     DatabaseMappers? SchemaMappers? TableMappers?
// each optional, none repeatable. This writes TableMappers before SchemaMappers.
//
// They are semicolon-terminated named sections in a parenthesised body -- the exact shape
// of a record whose fields may be given in any order, and there is no reason a reader would
// think otherwise. A rewrite that reads them as such is more permissive than legend-engine,
// which is the divergence that never shows up as a failure.
###QueryPostProcessor
RelationalMapper fixture::neg::SectionOrder
(
   TableMappers:
   [
      fixture::neg::AccountDB.alloytest.ACCOUNT -> 'AccountTable'
   ];
   SchemaMappers:
   [
      fixture::neg::AccountDB.alloytest -> 'AlloySchema'
   ];
)
